# CODEOWNERS — required for the "Require review from Code Owners" branch
# protection rule. GitHub reads this file from .github/, the repo root, or
# docs/; only the first one it finds is used.
#
# Every pull request needs an approval from the matching code owner before it
# can merge into main.
#
# Syntax: <pattern> <owner>...   (@user, @org/team, or an e-mail)

# Default owner for everything in the repository.
